      "assessment": {
        "nobel_worthiness": "WMAP's precise mapping of the cosmic microwave background established a high precision cosmological picture and constrained the universe's age, composition, and geometry. The result has lasting significance for fundamental physics.",
        "attribution": "Bennett and Page were central to the mission and its measurements; Spergel made major contributions to interpretation. The division between experimental achievement and theoretical analysis deserves close review.",
        "maturity": "The observations were independently tested and substantially extended by later CMB experiments.",
